# Files to be ignored by git in a DataFlex workspace

# AppHtml
**/apphtml/global.asa

# AppSrc
**/AppSrc/**/*.prn
**/AppSrc/**/*.dep
**/AppSrc/**/*.dbg
**/AppSrc/**/*.exe.manifest
**/AppSrc/**/*.err
**/AppSrc/**/*.fld
**/AppSrc/**/*.pbg
**/AppSrc/**/*.pdp
**/AppSrc/**/*.pkd
**/AppSrc/**/*.prn
**/AppSrc/**/*.prp
**/AppSrc/**/CompileHeader.h
**/AppSrc/**/loginEncryptionkey.inc

# Data
**/Data/**/*.log
**/Data/**/*.dat
**/Data/**/*.vld
**/Data/**/*.k*
**/Data/**/*.bad
**/Data/**/*.hdr
**/Data/**/*.cch
**/Data/**/*.cfg

# DDSrc
**/DdSrc/**/*.def

# IdeSrc
**/IdeSrc/*.dsk
**/IdeSrc/*.loc
**/IdeSrc/*.mtd

# Programs
**/Programs/*.dbg
**/Programs/*.exe
**/Programs/*.exe.manifest
**/Programs/*.log

# Workspace specific
**/Data/compileheader.h
**/Help/**/*.hnd
**/Help/**/Assets
**/Help/**/Online Help
**/HelpText**/*.*
**/Install
**/Capture
LoginEncryptionKey.inc

# df-cli installs the packages the DataFlex 26 library files name (vwin32fh, for RDCToolsLib) here
DfPkg/
*.sws.lock
# The two setup files the DFUnit package drops into the workspace folder
/SetupUnitTests.bat
/SetupUnitTests.ps1
